<title>ITALY: Gross yield falls at Italy 18-mo CTZ bill auction.</title>
<headline>Gross yield falls at Italy 18-mo CTZ bill auction.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for the 2.0 trillion lire auction of a fifth tranche of 18-month October 15, 1998 Italian Treasury zero coupon certificates (CTZ), and 2.5 trillion lire auction of a new first tranche of May 14, 1999 two-year CTZs.</p>
<p>		    Oct 15, 98  Pvs    May 14, 99  Pvs</p>
<p>Net Yield	 5.67 pct    5.93   5.73 pct    6.02</p>
<p>Gross Yield     6.50	  6.77   6.52	  6.84</p>
<p>Assigned price 91.45	 90.85  88.15	 88.30</p>
<p>Bids	     6.612 trillion lire 6.788 trillion lire</p>
<p>Assigned	 2.000 trillion lire 2.500 trillion lire</p>
<p>Note - Results from the previous two-year certificate auction are not directly comparable because the last sale was of a March 15, 1999 CTZ. Results for the 18-month auction are compared with a previous auction of CTZs on April 22.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129502</p>
</text>
